### Recuperar todos los noticias
GET http://localhost:3000/api/news

### Recuperar un noticia por id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/news/17

### Crear un noticia
POST http://localhost:3000/api/news
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "titlesvvsswitch",
  "content": " ",
  "image_url": "",
  "author_id": 1,
  "category_id": 7,
  "state": "pendiente"
}

### Actualizar un noticia por id
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/news/35
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "UserpPro"
}

### Eliminar un noticia por id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/news/11

